      "en": ["The Cifra Palace (Cifrapalota), built in 1902, is covered in vibrant Zsolnay majolica tiles featuring traditional Hungarian folk motifs.", "Kecskemét's historic City Hall features a unique carillon of 37 bells that plays works by Mozart, Beethoven, and Kodály daily.", "The city is a major center for Hungarian animation and famously produced the beloved 'Hungarian Folk Tales' cartoon series.", "Kecskemét is economically crucial to modern Hungary, hosting a massive Mercedes-Benz manufacturing plant that drives the regional economy."]
