      "en": ["The Mayfly Bridge in Szolnok, spanning 444 meters, is the longest pedestrian and bicycle bridge in Central Europe.", "RepTár is an interactive aviation museum displaying dozens of restored military aircraft, helicopters, and anti-aircraft missiles.", "The city is home to the prestigious Szolnok Artists' Colony, which has been a center for Hungarian landscape painting for over a century.", "Szolnok's historic railway station was once a major stop on the legendary Orient Express route connecting Paris to Istanbul."]
