      "en": ["The town is home to the spectacular Hungarian Open Air Museum (Skanzen), the largest of its kind in the country, showcasing regional rural architecture.", "Szentendre's Blagovestenska Orthodox Church features a stunning, masterfully carved Rococo iconostasis created in the 18th century.", "The Margit Kovács Ceramic Museum is one of the town's most popular attractions, dedicated to the whimsical, highly emotional works of the famous sculptor.", "Despite its small size, Szentendre historically housed seven different active ethnic churches, reflecting its diverse immigrant foundations."]
