      "en": ["The Csiky Gergely Theatre in Kaposvár is one of the largest and most architecturally stunning Secessionist theaters in Hungary, recently undergoing a massive renovation.", "The city center features a unique, historic pharmacy (Arany Oroszlán) that has retained its original, highly ornate 19th-century wooden furnishings.", "Kaposvár is a major university town, heavily specializing in agricultural and veterinary sciences, driving the region's economy.", "The Rippl-Rónai Villa is surrounded by a sprawling, beautiful park where the painter famously hosted the greatest Hungarian artists and writers of his era."]
