      "en": ["The Veszprém Castle District is essentially one single, winding street perched on a rocky ridge, culminating at a breathtaking cliffside lookout.", "St. Michael's Cathedral in Veszprém is the oldest episcopal seat in Hungary, originally founded in the 10th century by Queen Gisela.", "The city is famous for its towering Viaduct (Völgyhíd), a spectacular arched bridge spanning a deep valley right near the city center.", "Veszprém boasts a massive, highly successful handball culture, with its local men's team regularly competing in the finals of the European Champions League."]
