    id: "tisza-folyo",
    type: "river",
    parent: "HU-CS",
    coords: [20.15, 46.25],
    name: {"de": "Theiß", "hu": "Tisza", "ro": "Tisa", "en": "Tisza"},
    image: "/geo-images/hungary/tisza-folyo.webp",
    description: {"de": "Die Theiß ist der zweitlängste Fluss Ungarns und prägt maßgeblich die Landschaft der Großen Tiefebene.", "hu": "A Tisza Magyarország második leghosszabb folyója, amely meghatározza az Alföld tájegységének képét.", "ro": "Tisa este al doilea cel mai lung râu din Ungaria și modelează peisajul Marii Câmpii Maghiare.", "en": "The Tisza is the second longest river in Hungary and significantly shapes the landscape of the Great Plain."},
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      "de": "Zalakaros ist einer der jüngsten, aber beliebtesten Kurorte in Südwestungarn. Bis in die 1960er Jahre war es ein unbekanntes kleines Bauerndorf, bis Ölbohrungen zufällig auf eine 96 Grad heiße Thermalquelle in über 2.000 Metern Tiefe stießen. Dieses einzigartige Heilwasser, das extrem reich an Schwefel, Jod, Brom und Fluor ist, verwandelte den Ort rasch in ein Mekka des Gesundheitstourismus. Das Thermal-, Heil- und Erlebnisbad von Zalakaros wurde im Laufe der Jahrzehnte stetig erweitert und bietet heute überdachte Badelandschaften, riesige Rutschenparks und Heilzentren inmitten eines grünen Waldes. Die gepflegte Kurstadt ist von Weinbergen und Obstgärten umgeben, die das idyllische Bild abrunden.",
      "hu": "",
      "ro": "Râul Tisa, cu meandrele sale fascinante și peisajele salbatice, este adesea considerat cel mai \\\\\\\"maghiar\\\\\\\" râu, străbătând inima Marii Câmpii. Tisa oferă un paradis pentru iubitorii de natură, cu rezervații ecologice impresionante, plaje de nisip fine și sate tradiționale pescărești presărate de-a lungul malurilor sale. Ecoturismul se află la el acasă aici, de la tururi cu caiacul prin galeriile de sălcii până la explorarea faunei bogate a Lacului Tisa, un lac de acumulare care a devenit o zonă umedă uimitoare. Vara, fenomene naturale unice precum \\\\\\\"înflorirea Tisei\\\\\\\" atrag spectatori din întreaga lume. Râul Tisa reprezintă liniștea și frumusețea pură a Ungariei de Est, un loc unde ritmul vieții este dictat de natură.",
      "en": "The Tisza River is deeply embedded in the soul, poetry, and history of the Hungarian people, often romantically referred to as the 'most Hungarian river.' It meanders beautifully through the vast, expansive landscapes of the Great Hungarian Plain, creating an incredibly rich, diverse ecosystem of oxbow lakes, dense floodplain forests, and sandy river beaches. Unlike the highly industrialized Danube, the Tisza retains a wilder, highly authentic, and untamed character, making it the ultimate destination for eco-tourism, multi-day canoe expeditions, and serene angling. The river's dramatic history of devastating floods has forced the construction of massive protective dikes, which today serve as hundreds of kilometers of pristine, uninterrupted bicycle paths through untouched nature."
    },
  factsAdvanced: {
    de: [],
    hu: [],
    ro: [
      "Râul Tisa este unul dintre principalii afluenți ai Dunării, cu o lungime totală de 966 de kilometri.",
      "\\\\\\\"Înflorirea Tisei\\\\\\\" este un fenomen spectaculos de împerechere a insectelor Palingenia longicauda care are loc anual în luna iunie.",
      "Lacul Tisa, creat în anii '70 ca rezervor, a fost inclus în Patrimoniul Mondial UNESCO ca parte a Parcului Național Hortobágy.",
      "În secolul al XIX-lea, cursul Tisei a fost scurtat semnificativ prin ample lucrări de regularizare conduse de contele István Széchenyi."
    ],
    "en": ["The Tisza is incredibly famous for the 'Tisza blooming' (Tiszavirágzás), a spectacular natural phenomenon where millions of massive mayflies emerge for a single day in June.", "Following a massive 19th-century river regulation project led by István Széchenyi, the length of the highly winding river was shortened by over 400 kilometers.", "The artificial damming of the river in the 1970s created Lake Tisza, which has since evolved into a highly protected UNESCO bird sanctuary and eco-tourism hub.", "The river was notoriously unpredictable and dangerous before regulation, causing the catastrophic 1879 flood that completely wiped the city of Szeged off the map."]
  },
    facts: {"de": ["Berühmt für die 'Theißblüte', das spektakuläre Massenschlüpfen von Eintagsfliegen.", "Ein wichtiges Gebiet für den Wassertourismus und den Fischfang im Land."], "hu": ["Híres a tiszavirágzásról, a kérészek látványos tömeges rajzásáról.", "Az ország egyik legfontosabb területe a vízitúrázás és a horgászat számára."], "ro": ["Faimos pentru 'înflorirea Tisei', roirea spectaculoasă a efemeridelor.", "O zonă importantă pentru turismul nautic și pescuitul din țară."], "en": ["Famous for the 'Tisza blooming', a spectacular mass swarming of mayflies.", "An important area for water tourism and fishing in the country."]},
